@page /about
@mode SSG
@tag home

<h1>About this site</h1>
<p>This entire site is C#: layouts and partials are .volt templates spliced at compile time, pages are static (SSG), HTML is minified by the generator and at render time, and the counter on the <a href="/islands">islands page</a> is a hydrated C# component.</p>
<p>No npm, no webpack, no node_modules — one dotnet project.</p>
